040" end="00:22.610">kicks </span><span begin="00:22.610" end="00:23.030">in </span><span begin="00:23.030" end="00:23.210">and </span><span begin="00:23.210" end="00:23.240">I </span><span begin="00:23.240" end="00:23.810">start </span><span begin="00:23.810" end="00:23.930">to </span><span begin="00:23.930" end="00:25.790">see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.320" end="00:28.880"><span begin="00:27.320" end="00:27.710">The </span><span begin="00:27.710" end="00:27.980">edge </span><span begin="00:27.980" end="00:28.100">of </span><span begin="00:28.100" end="00:28.220">the </span><span begin="00:28.220" end="00:28.880">bed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.880" end="00:32.420"><span begin="00:28.880" end="00:29.090">Where </span><span begin="00:29.090" end="00:29.240">your </span><span begin="00:29.240" end="00:30.230">nightgown </span><span begin="00:30.230" end="00:30.680">used </span><span begin="00:30.680" end="00:30.860">to </span><span begin="00:30.860" end="00:32.420">be</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.880" end="00:38.960"><span begin="00:34.880" end="00:35.210">I </span><span begin="00:35.210" end="00:35.750">told </span><span begin="00:35.750" end="00:36.740">myself </span><span begin="00:36.740" end="00:37.040">I </span><span begin="00:37.040" end="00:37.460">wouldn't </span><span begin="00:37.460" end="00:38.360">miss </span><span begin="00:38.360" end="00:38.960">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.320" end="00:42.110"><span begin="00:39.320" end="00:39.740">But </span><span begin="00:39.740" end="00:40.040">I </span><span begin="00:40.040" end="00:42.110">remembered</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.140" end="00:47.690"><span begin="00:42.140" end="00:42.740">What </span><span begin="00:42.740" end="00:42.950">it </span><span begin="00:42.950" end="00:43.550">feels </span><span begin="00:43.550" end="00:43.940">like </span><span begin="00:43.940" end="00:45.260">beside </span><span begin="00:45.260" end="00:47.690">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.350" end="00:51.800"><span begin="00:48.350" end="00:48.560">I </span><span begin="00:48.560" end="00:49.040">really </span><span begin="00:49.040" end="00:49.520">miss </span><span begin="00:49.520" end="00:49.910">your </span><span begin="00:49.910" end="00:50.480">hair </span><span begin="00:50.480" end="00:50.780">in </span><span begin="00:50.780" end="00:51.140">my </span><span begin="00:51.140" end="00:51.800">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.070" end="00:55.400"><span begin="00:52.070" end="00:52.340">And </span><span begin="00:52.340" end="00:52.460">the </span><span begin="00:52.460" end="00:52.940">way </span><span begin="00:52.940" end="00:53.450">your </span><span begin="00:53.450" end="00:54.650">innocence </span><span begin="00:54.650" end="00:55.400">tastes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.910" end="00:59.690"><span begin="00:55.910" end="00:56.480">And </span><span begin="00:56.480" end="00:56.690">I </span><span begin="00:56.690" end="00:57.230">think </span><span begin="00:57.230" end="00:57.530">you </span><span begin="00:57.530" end="00:58.040">should </span><span begin="00:58.040" end="00:58.910">know </span><span begin="00:58.910" end="00:59.690">this</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.720" end="01:04.970"><span begin="00:59.720" end="01:00.050">You </span><span begin="01:00.050" end="01:00.650">deserve </span><span begin="01:00.650" end="01:01.070">much </span><span begin="01:01.070" end="01:01.520">better </span><span begin="01:01.520" end="01:01.910">than </span><span begin="01:01.910" end="01:04.970">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.190" end="01:20.660"><span begin="01:16.190" end="01:16.490">While </span><span begin="01:16.490" end="01:17.120">looking </span><span begin="01:17.120" end="01:17.540">through </span><span begin="01:17.540" end="01:17.900">your </span><span begin="01:17.900" end="01:18.230">old </span><span begin="01:18.230" end="01:18.740">b